  "body": "The tag [recommends](https://github.com/WICG/webusb/pull/92#issuecomment-332228298) building an explainer document as developer-facing documentation as extracting information about how to use an API from the full specification is difficult. This will likely include copies of the examples from the specification but with more developer-centric explanations.\r\n\r\nIdeas I have for this include a walkthrough of not only how to connect to a device but also how the device is expected to behave as this is a common developer question.",
